  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole lightly built iguanodontian with proportionately shorter forelimbs than Iguanodon. Not a scaled or recoloured stout Iguanodon.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic living reconstruction based on holotype NHMUK PV R5764. Museum mount contains80–90% real bones; displayed skull is a cast assembled from preserved separate skull bones and some missing parts are replicated. Seven metres is a species-level approximate display length, not direct measurement of this specimen. Pose, skin and colour inferred.\",\"zh\":\"依据正模NHMUK PV R5764的完整活体美术复原。装架含80–90%真骨，展示头骨是依据分离原骨组合的翻模，部分缺失骨骼补配。7米为物种近似展示尺度，不是该个体实测；姿态、皮肤与颜色属推断。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":364,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Mantellisaurus\",\"zh\":\"曼特尔龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Mantellisaurus atherfieldensis\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda, Iguanodontia\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":7.0,\"basis\":\"Approximate species length stated by UK Environment Agency2023; not measurement of R5764 or identification proof for reported footprints.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Lighter narrower trunk/shoulder build than Iguanodon bernissartensis at normalized scale.\",\"Forelimbs conspicuously shorter relative to hindlimbs than Iguanodon; do not stretch arms into stocky quadruped pose.\",\"Low elongate beaked skull, modest thumb spikes and grasping/laterally separate outer digits.\",\"Long balancing tail, near-horizontal trunk in chosen bipedal stance; no tail-supported kangaroo posture.\",\"Whole animal without horn, sail or hadrosaur crest.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Official NHM photograph of holotype in Hintze Hall actually viewed; NHM catalogue search identifies PV R5764, approx165bones. Museum account directly distinguishes lighter build and shorter forelimbs from Iguanodon.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole lightly built iguanodontian with proportionately shorter forelimbs than Iguanodon. Not a scaled or recoloured stout Iguanodon.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic living reconstruction based on holotype NHMUK PV R5764. Museum mount contains80–90% real bones; displayed skull is a cast assembled from preserved separate skull bones and some missing parts are replicated. Seven metres is a species-level approximate display length, not direct measurement of this specimen. Pose, skin and colour inferred.\",\"zh\":\"依据正模NHMUK PV R5764的完整活体美术复原。装架含80–90%真骨，展示头骨是依据分离原骨组合的翻模，部分缺失骨骼补配。7米为物种近似展示尺度，不是该个体实测；姿态、皮肤与颜色属推断。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":364,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Mantellisaurus\",\"zh\":\"曼特尔龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Mantellisaurus atherfieldensis\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda, Iguanodontia\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":7.0,\"basis\":\"Approximate species length stated by UK Environment Agency2023; not measurement of R5764 or identification proof for reported footprints.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Lighter narrower trunk/shoulder build than Iguanodon bernissartensis at normalized scale.\",\"Forelimbs conspicuously shorter relative to hindlimbs than Iguanodon; do not stretch arms into stocky quadruped pose.\",\"Low elongate beaked skull, modest thumb spikes and grasping/laterally separate outer digits.\",\"Long balancing tail, near-horizontal trunk in chosen bipedal stance; no tail-supported kangaroo posture.\",\"Whole animal without horn, sail or hadrosaur crest.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Official NHM photograph of holotype in Hintze Hall actually viewed; NHM catalogue search identifies PV R5764, approx165bones. Museum account directly distinguishes lighter build and shorter forelimbs from Iguanodon.\"}"
  },
